Package: dgpsi
Type: Package
Title: Computer Model Emulation Using Gaussian Process Networks
Version: 2.6.0-9000
Authors@R: c(
  person('Deyu', 'Ming', role = c('aut', 'cre', 'cph'),
         email = 'deyu.ming.16@ucl.ac.uk'),
  person('Daniel', 'Williamson', role = c('aut'),
         email = 'd.williamson@exeter.ac.uk')
  )
Maintainer: Deyu Ming <deyu.ming.16@ucl.ac.uk>
Description: Provides tools for scalable computer model emulation using Gaussian process networks.
             The implementations follow Ming & Guillas (2021) <doi:10.1137/20M1323771> for linked Gaussian processes,
             Ming, Williamson, & Guillas (2023) <doi:10.1080/00401706.2022.2124311> for deep Gaussian processes, 
             Ming & Williamson (2023) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2306.01212> for linked deep Gaussian processes, and 
             Ming & Williamson (2026) <doi:10.1016/j.csda.2026.108485> for generalized deep Gaussian processes.
             To get started with the package, see <https://mingdeyu.github.io/dgpsi-R/>.
